student_response:
I see what I did wrong now. When we divide by a whole number we have to write that whole number as a fraction (3 = 3⁄1) and then multiply by its reciprocal.

So

\[
\frac{2}{5}\div 3 \;=\; \frac{2}{5}\div \frac{3}{1}
\;=\; \frac{2}{5}\times\frac{1}{3}
\;=\; \frac{2\cdot1}{5\cdot3}
\;=\; \frac{2}{15}.
\]

